  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/10/IMG_3409.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El campo de vuelo municipal de Onda ha acogido este domingo el Open de Aeromodelismo, con exposici&oacute;n, y jornadas de vuelo y acrobacia. Como cada domingo antes de Fira, lo ha organizado el Club Radio Control Onda.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/aeromodelismefira13/img_3386.jpg\" alt=\"img_3386\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/aeromodelismefira13/img_3387.jpg\" alt=\"img_3387\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/aeromodelismefira13/img_3388.jpg\" alt=\"img_3388\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/aeromodelismefira13/img_3389.jpg\" alt=\"img_3389\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/aeromodelismefira13/img_3390.jpg\" alt=\"img_3390\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/aeromodelismefira13/img_3391.jpg\" alt=\"img_3391\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/aeromodelismefira13/img_3392.jpg\" alt=\"img_3392\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/aeromodelismefira13/img_3393.jpg\" alt=\"img_3393\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/aeromodelismefira13/img_3394.jpg\" alt=\"img_3394\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/aeromodelismefira13/img_3395.jpg\" alt=\"img_3395\" style=\"max-widt